\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had a great rodent-based Lunar in a game a few years ago.<br /> <br /> Successes: That character, and his solution to the First Age spiders that kept rebuilding the bad guy's citadel.<br /> <br /> Failures: My attempt at an Ability-based Lunar charmset. (Homebrew system didn't use the standard Attributes.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I would love to know how you tried to approach that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T09:46:52-07:00","id":1125,"title":"","content":"I made a pacifistic princess Lunar once.<br /> <br /> I ran around convincing Abyssals to fight for Love and Friendship.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">https://swordofcreation.net/</a> : A secondary forum focusing on archiving homebrew, both mechanical and fluff, and receiving critique on it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/108-flare","name":"Flare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar108_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T09:51:18-07:00","id":1128,"title":"","content":"I made a 2e lunar once. It ate and shagged things a lot.<br /> <br /> Successes: Shagging, eating, being